  "derivation": "TLV framing is 1-byte type, 2-byte big-endian length, value -- transcribed from CourierEnvelope.encode. Field values (0xAB x 16 tag, expiry 1900000000000, 0x42 x 128 ciphertext) are the CourierEnvelopeTests fixtures. Recipient tags are HMAC-SHA256(key, \"bitchat-courier-tag-v1\" || bigEndian(epochDay)) truncated to 16 bytes, computed with python hmac.",
